## HAWS Antigravity adapter

This file is registration metadata for Google Antigravity. Load canonical
standards from `core/HAWS.md` and `core/WORK_INSTRUCTIONS.md`, and private
preferences from `secondbrain/USER_PREFERENCES.md` and
`secondbrain/ANTI_PATTERNS.md`.

Skills remain discoverable from the HAWS `skills/` catalog; their contents are
not duplicated here.
